'<p>The overwhelming response to the mixer underscored the growing need for curated, high-intent GCC leadership communities in India. With 700+ registrations, the event saw strong interest from across the ecosystem. A highly selective cohort of 70 senior leaders was shortlisted, with 45+ leaders confirmed, ensuring a room defined by depth, relevance, and peer-level engagement. The evening brought together an exceptional mix of leadership from organisations such as Microsoft, Samsung, EY, Bain &amp; Company, Bank of America, GoDaddy, NatWest, S&amp;P Global, Gartner, Genpact, Optum, JLL, Fractal, TransUnion, Bupa Capability Center, LiveRamp, Indeed, Merck Group, Verizon, and Acuity Analytics, among others. Together, it marked a powerful step towards building a more connected, collaborative, and future-ready GCC leadership ecosystem in India.</p>',
